sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as ScanAnalysisPipeline
  participant H as ScanHistoryRepository
  participant C as OfflineCache<br/>(JSON file)
  participant Q as SyncQueue
  participant F as Firestore
  participant RS as RecentScanActivitiesScene
  P->>H: Add(record) or Replace(same id) on re-scan
  H->>C: save list on the phone
  H->>Q: EnqueueSet users/uid/scans/id
  alt online
    Q->>F: write
  else offline
    Q->>Q: keep, retry when ConnectivityMonitor says reachable
  end
  RS->>H: list (phone copy, works offline)
  RS->>H: remove (to trash), restore, rename (phone only)
